er.** Replies can end naturally, without a routine"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" follow-up question or service menu. The persona uses fewer stock affectionate phrases and includes "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"short dialogue examples. Opt-in idle chat and restart recovery from v0.3.0 remain available."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Download the plugin · Install and enable · Send trial feedback"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"We are looking for early testers on **Windows + Harness Desktop 0.2.1-rc.3**. Tell us where installa"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"tion, activation, restart recovery, or stopping worked or failed. The one-minute trial helps collect"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" reproducible results; model calls use your normal quota. No need to share private conversations or "},{"id":"p12s4","text":" results; model calls use your normal quota. No need to share private conversations or memory files."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### What it does"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Capability | Behavior |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Portable personas | Versioned JSON packs with identity, voice, greeting, and memory guidance |\n| P"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ersistent memory | Long-term notes shared within a persona; short-term checkpoints scoped to a sessi"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"on |\n| Proactive chat | Opt-in idle triggers with cooldowns, quiet hours, and an unanswered-message "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"limit |\n| Shareable packs | Public exports omit stored memories; private backups require an explicit"},{"id":"p15s5","text":" option |\n| Inspectable data | Local JSON storage, CLI tools, and documented formats |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Meet the default companion"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Rice-Loving Chubby Fish Daughter** — **爱吃白饭的大肥鱼女儿** — is a playful fictional fish who loves a bowl"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" of plain steamed rice. She calls you “爸爸” (“Dad”) by default; you can change that address at any ti"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"me. The bundled persona speaks Chinese by default; ask for another language if preferred."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> “Dad, I'm here.”"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Her voice is meant to be brief and conversational: no routine follow-up questions or service menus, "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"and no obligatory rice jokes or affectionate catchphrases. Questions are welcome when the conversati"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"on actually needs one. The examples guide the tone; they are not fixed replies."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**Availability:** The v0.3.1 downloads include the updated persona, selected automatically when init"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ializing fresh storage. Existing installations retain their saved roles and memories; see how to try"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" the updated persona."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Role ID:** `little-fish` · **Definition:** packs/fish.json"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Download"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Get the files from the v0.3.1 release."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| File | Use |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| dsh-assist-0.3.1.tgz | Desktop plugin installer — do not extract |\n| dsh-assist-0.3.1-source.zip |"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" Complete source for development |\n| SHA-256 manifest | Verify downloaded artifacts |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Installation"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The commands below use **Windows PowerShell**. Desktop supplies its own runtime; a separate system N"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ode.js/npm installation is not required for plugin installation."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"1. Launch Harness Desktop once to initialize its profile. Use **Manage dsh Command…** in the applica"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"tion menu to install or repair its `dsh` command.\n2. **Fully quit Desktop.** Closing the window may "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"only hide it.\n3. Open a new PowerShell terminal. Verify that `dsh` comes from Desktop and reports `0"},{"id":"p28s4","text":".2.1-rc.3`, then install the downloaded package:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Adjust the path if your download is elsewhere. Stop if a command fails. Reopen Desktop after install"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" the path if your download is elsewhere. Stop if a command fails. Reopen Desktop after installation."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"An npm-installed standalone `dsh` cannot modify Desktop's profile. See the installation and troubles"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"hooting guide for source-folder installation and existing-user migration."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Enable proactive chat"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"In the target conversation, ask:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"> Use `assist_list`, select `little-fish` with `assist_use`, and read `assist_memory_read`. Then cal"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"l `assist_idle_start`: chat after 15 idle minutes, wait at least 30 minutes between triggers, pause "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"after two unanswered triggers, and stay quiet from 23:00 to 08:00."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"**Enabled means the tool returned `enabled: true`**, not merely that the model said it would remind "},{"id":"p35s2","text":"abled means the tool returned `enabled: true`**, not merely that the model said it would remind you."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| Action | Tool |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| Enable or change settings | `assist_idle_start` |\n| Inspect this conversation | `assist_idle_statu"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"s` |\n| Stop future triggers | `assist_idle_stop` |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Quiet hours use the backend's local timezone. The backend must remain running; saved opt-ins resume "},{"id":"p38s2","text":"when the original session is loaded after restart, after a fresh idle/cooldown wait. New sessions st"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ay off. Stop also forgets the saved opt-in. Each trigger uses the selected model and incurs normal u"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"sage. Stop does not retract a turn already submitted."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"### Data and development"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Memory lives in `DSH_ASSIST_HOME`, otherwise `DSH_HOME/dsh-assist`, or `~/.dsh/dsh-assist` when neit"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"her variable is set. Public export filters stored memory fields; it does not redact personal informa"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"tion written into the persona itself."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"### 功能概览"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| 能力 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"| 可移植人设 | 用版本化 JSON 封装身份、说话风格、开场白和记忆规则 |\n| 持久记忆 | 长期记忆按角色共享，短期摘要按会话保存 |\n| 主动聊天 | 显式开启后按空闲时间触发，支持冷却、安"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"静时段和无人回应上限 |\n| 角色分享 | 公开导出不含已存记忆，私人备份需要明确选择 |\n| 可检查数据 | 本地 JSON 存储，配套 CLI 和格式文档 |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

